I wrote a little program to report the total deltaG and sigma that
are obtained from a complete FEP calculation. You may already have
a similar script, but if you don't you can obtain sumdelg from my
top directory on doctor.

First grep your sum files for "DeltaG":

grep DeltaG *sum* >>delgsum

This will give you in delgsum something like

